        <headline>Small Craft Advisory issued September 24 at 9:15PM PDT until September 25 at 5:00PM PDT by NWS Eureka CA</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Steep seas 7 to 10 feet expected.

* WHERE...Coastal waters from Pt. St. George to Cape Mendocino
CA out 10 nm.

* WHEN...From 2 AM to 5 PM PDT Friday.

* IMPACTS...Conditions will be hazardous to small craft.
</description>
        <instruction>Inexperienced mariners, especially those operating smaller
vessels, should avoid navigating in hazardous conditions.</instruction>
